; Does a package arospkg installed actually RUN?
;
; Nothing in this project has shown that yet. Installing files is not evidence
; that a program works, and sdlpop is in the index because its metadata was
; reviewed, not because anyone started it.

FAILAT 21

Echo "== install and launch sdlpop =="
RAM:apkg --version

Delete SYS:PkgRun ALL FORCE QUIET
Delete SYS:PkgRunReports ALL FORCE QUIET
MakeDir SYS:PkgRun
MakeDir SYS:PkgRunReports

RAM:apkg --root SYS:PkgRun --run-id s1 --expect 0 --report SYS:PkgRunReports/s1.json update
RAM:apkg --root SYS:PkgRun --run-id s2 --expect 0 --report SYS:PkgRunReports/s2.json search sdlpop
Echo "*Ninstalling (1.4 MB over TLS, this takes a moment):"
RAM:apkg --root SYS:PkgRun --run-id s3 --expect 0 --report SYS:PkgRunReports/s3.json install sdlpop
Echo "*Nwhat was installed:"
List SYS:PkgRun/sdlpop
Echo "== now launch it =="
